{"text": "It looked like a good idea, but wait until I tell you what happened. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bill Driscoll and I were down South in Alabama when this kidnapping idea came to us. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> We had about six hundred dollars, but we needed two thousand more for a dishonest land plan. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In Summit, a town as flat as a pancake, we chose the only son of a rich man named Ebenezer Dorset. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy was ten years old, with lots of freckles and bright red hair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About two miles from Summit, there was a small mountain covered with thick cedar trees. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the far side of the mountain was a cave, and we stored our food there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One evening we drove a buggy past old Dorsets house and found the boy throwing stones at a kitten. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When Bill offered him candy and a nice ride, the boy hit him in the eye with a brick. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That will cost the old man an extra five hundred dollars, said Bill, climbing over the wheel. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boy fought like a little bear, but at last we got him into the buggy and drove away.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", "t", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "g", "o", "o", "d", " ", "i", "d", "e", "a", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "w", "a", "i", "t", " ", "u", "n", "t", "i", "l", " ", "I", " ", "t", "e", "l", "l", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "a", "p", "p", "e", "n", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "i", "l", "l", " ", "D", "r", "i", "s", "c", "o", "l", "l", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "I", " ", "w", "e", "r", "e", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "S", "o", "u", "t", "h", " ", "i", "n", " ", "A", "l", "a", "b", "a", "m", "a", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "k", "i", "d", "n", "a", "p", "